  "privacyTitle": "Privacy notice",
  "privacyBody": "Ready72 processes the names, ages and weights of your household, and the free-text description of needs you choose to give, to build a 72-hour bag plan. Health information is special-category data under the GDPR. We process it only with your explicit consent and only for this purpose.\n\nEverything is computed and stored on this device. There is no first-party server, no analytics about you, and no advertising. The optional AI client is not used in this build. You can withdraw consent, export your data or delete everything in one action below. Deleting removes your household, needs, plan, order, subscription and packing progress from this device.",
